Description: OWASP Coraza web application firewall module for Nginx
 Coraza is a web application firewall engine that reads ModSecurity's rule
 language (SecLang) and runs the OWASP Core Rule Set. This module runs it
 inline in Nginx, per server or location, with the directives coraza,
 coraza_rules and coraza_rules_file.
 .
 The engine is loaded from libcoraza in each worker process.
